# cursor-jump — шаги записи (что показывается — cursor-jump.md)
# Его слово 2026-10-06: круг прыжка — отдельным GIF от настроек каретки (cursor).
title Cursor jump highlight | A circle marks where the cursor lands
open Cursor.md
# Родная каретка: GIF про то, где она оказывается.
rec-caret off
caret ## Monday
stage Default Obsidian
say Default: Jump down → hard to see where the cursor lands
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
expect ## Monday

stage Jump highlight
say Highlight where you land → on
settings Visual
set Highlight where you land = on
set Highlight size = 40
set How long it lasts = 1200
caret ## Monday
say Jump down → a circle marks where it lands
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
expect ## Monday

stage Inside the line
say Use inside current line → on
settings Visual
set Use inside current line = on
caret - [ ] #todo #low || Buy groceries || 📅2026-10-07 @ Buy groceries
say Jump right → the circle inside the line too
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
expect ## Monday
